OL,3,AJust Eat apologises for AI food
OL,4,Amistakes after social media ridicule
OL,5,
OL,6,FJust Eat has apologised after it was
OL,7,Fridiculed online over a series of
OL,8,Fmistakes with AI-generated pictures for
OL,9,Fsome of its restaurants' food items.
OL,11,FThe online food delivery platform had
OL,12,Fbeen testing out the tech to showcase
OL,13,Ffood which didn't have images yet - but
OL,14,Fnot all turned out as planned.
OL,16,FInstead the AI invented several bizarre
OL,17,Fconcoctions, from bacon and eggs
OL,18,Ffloating in a glass of cola - a
OL,19,Fconfusion between "soda" and "soda
OL,20,Fbread" - to chips poking out of
OL,21,Fmuffins.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,114,105,200,160,0,100
