OL,3,AJust Eat apologises for AI food
OL,4,Amistakes after social media ridicule
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Just Eat spokesperson said the firm
OL,7,Fwas "in the process of removing" the
OL,8,Fincorrect images, and would stop making
OL,9,Fmore until the AI was further
OL,10,Fdeveloped.
